          "message": "add a pattern to remove idempotent DUS from a while (#1921)\n\n* add a pattern to remove idempotent DUS from a while\n\nThis replaces stablehlo.while with a stablehlo.if when its results are DUS not\ndepending on anything in the loop.\n\n* fix\n\n* fix\n\n* fix\n\n* fix: test (#1928)\n\n* fix\n\n* fix\n\n* Update reactant_commit in test-gb-25.yml\n\nRemoved 'while_idempotent_dus' from reactant_commit.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: William S. Moses <gh@wsmoses.com>\nCo-authored-by: Avik Pal <avikpal@mit.edu>\nCo-authored-by: William Moses <wmoses@google.com>",
