          "message": "Add multirotate and multislice operations (#1953)\n\n* Initial plan\n\n* Add MultiRotate and MultiSlice op definitions with basic optimizations\n\nCo-authored-by: wsmoses <1260124+wsmoses@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* remove folder\n\nThis fold is also achieved by optimization + fold of rotate\n\n* I64ArrayAttr --> DenseI64ArrayAttr\n\n* add verifiers\n\n* filecheck test for verifiers\n\n* multislice: verify inbounds indices\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: copilot-swe-agent[bot] <198982749+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: wsmoses <1260124+wsmoses@users.noreply.github.com>",
