          "id": "2d3922c5efd1f74bc42402b9047afe431bdeab65",
          "message": "ProbProg: MCMC (#1943)\n\n* rename loop -> for_loop\n\n* generalize enzyme.dot\n\n* log_add_exp lowering\n\n* enzyme.randomSplit lowering\n\n* while_loop lowering\n\n* while test\n\n* random split test\n\n* Make enzyme.random op handle a/b parameter in uniform/normal cases\n\n* enzyme.dump int support\n\n* fix\n\n* more lowering\n\n* extended dynamic update\n\n* namespace conflict\n\n* raise math.ceil/floor\n\n* generalized select op lowering\n\n* cholesky and triangular solve ops lowering\n\n* [DROPME] qualified stablehlo::IfOp to avoid ambiguity with new enzyme::IfOp\n\n* [DROPME] qualified stablehlo::IfOp to avoid ambiguity with new enzyme::IfOp\n\n* minor\n\n* logistic op lowering\n\n* enzyme.random op numerics fix\n\n* enzyme.if op lowering\n\n* dynamic update op 1D generalization\n\n* rename: unflatten_slice --> recover_sample\n\n* update runOnOperation\n\n* test\n\n* test\n\n* [DROPME] update enzyme hash\n\n* cleanup",
